{"chunk_id": "fixture-zengshanbuyi:00000", "document_id": "fixture-zengshanbuyi", "source_id": "fixture", "title": "增刪卜易", "category_id": "liuyao", "chunk_index": 0, "char_start": 0, "char_end": 87, "character_count": 87, "content": "增刪卜易\n用神者，所問之事也；元神者，生用神之爻也。\n三合局者，申子辰合水局，亥卯未合木局，寅午戌合火局，巳酉丑合金局。\n伏神者，用神不上卦而伏於本宮也；月破者，月建沖爻也。"}
{"chunk_id": "fixture-huangjinze:00000", "document_id": "fixture-huangjinze", "source_id": "fixture", "title": "黄金策", "category_id": "liuyao", "chunk_index": 0, "char_start": 0, "char_end": 26, "character_count": 26, "content": "黄金策\n用神有真假，動靜有先後；旺相休囚，各以其時。"}
{"chunk_id": "fixture-qimen:00000", "document_id": "fixture-qimen", "source_id": "fixture", "title": "奇門遁甲統宗", "category_id": "qimen", "chunk_index": 0, "char_start": 0, "char_end": 62, "character_count": 62, "content": "奇門遁甲統宗\n八門：休門、生門、傷門、杜門、景門、死門、驚門、開門。\n八神：值符、螣蛇、太陰、六合、白虎、玄武、九地、九天。"}
{"chunk_id": "fixture-bazhai:00000", "document_id": "fixture-bazhai", "source_id": "fixture", "title": "八宅明鏡", "category_id": "yangzhai", "chunk_index": 0, "char_start": 0, "char_end": 46, "character_count": 46, "content": "八宅明鏡\n大遊年歌：乾六天五禍絕延生，坎五天生延絕禍六。\n遊年歌以伏位為主，按順逆飛布九星。"}
{"chunk_id": "fixture-xuankong:00000", "document_id": "fixture-xuankong", "source_id": "fixture", "title": "沈氏玄空學", "category_id": "kanyu", "chunk_index": 0, "char_start": 0, "char_end": 57, "character_count": 57, "content": "沈氏玄空學\n挨星、起星、替卦皆以運星入中，按二十四山陰陽順逆飛布。\n寅午庚丁上，右弼四星臨；中宮五到向，無替可尋。"}
{"chunk_id": "fixture-ziwei:00000", "document_id": "fixture-ziwei", "source_id": "fixture", "title": "紫微斗數全書", "category_id": "ziwei", "chunk_index": 0, "char_start": 0, "char_end": 36, "character_count": 36, "content": "紫微斗數全書\n太微賦：紫微為帝座，天府為令星；諸星布列十二宮，各有所主。"}
{"chunk_id": "fixture-liuren:00000", "document_id": "fixture-liuren", "source_id": "fixture", "title": "六壬大全", "category_id": "liuren", "chunk_index": 0, "char_start": 0, "char_end": 39, "character_count": 39, "content": "六壬大全\n月将者，正月登明，二月天魁，三月從魁，四月傳送，五月小吉，六月勝光。"}
{"chunk_id": "fixture-butian:00000", "document_id": "fixture-butian", "source_id": "fixture", "title": "步天歌", "category_id": "calendar", "chunk_index": 0, "char_start": 0, "char_end": 28, "character_count": 28, "content": "步天歌\n步天歌者，所以紀三垣二十八宿之次舍，便於仰觀也。"}
{"chunk_id": "fixture-sanming:00000", "document_id": "fixture-sanming", "source_id": "fixture", "title": "三命通會", "category_id": "mingli", "chunk_index": 0, "char_start": 0, "char_end": 35, "character_count": 35, "content": "三命通會\n流年、太歲、大運、行運、月令、提綱、元會運世，皆以干支推之。"}
{"chunk_id": "fixture-huangji:00000", "document_id": "fixture-huangji", "source_id": "fixture", "title": "皇極經世", "category_id": "xiangshu", "chunk_index": 0, "char_start": 0, "char_end": 34, "character_count": 34, "content": "皇極經世\n元會運世：一元十二會，一會三十運，一運十二世，一世三十年。"}
